//! The node types of the raw parse tree, with the names and the fields of the PostgreSQL headers.
//!
//! @generated by `cargo xtask sql` from the vendored headers in `vendor/postgres-19/src/include`, `errcodes.txt`, `pg_type.dat` and `gram.y`. Do not edit. `cargo xtask sql --check` runs in CI and fails if this file and the vendored files disagree.
//!
//! A `Node *` field is an `Option<Node>`, a `List *` field is a [`List`], which is empty for `NIL`, a `char *` field is an `Option<Str>`, and a field that points to a node type is an `Option<Box<..>>` of that type. An enum is a number with a constant for each value, so that the zero of `makeNode` is a value of every enum. The writer of each type gives the text of `nodeToString` with the locations. The `#define` constants that `gram.y` names come first.

